    articleSection: "",
    metaHtml: "",
    accordionItems: [{"question":"How many cars are in FR Legends?","answer":"The full roster spans more than 30 cars, from the classic Toyota AE86 and Mazda Miata to the Supra, RX-7, Skyline GT-R, and premium models like the Dodge Challenger and Porsche 911 GT3. New cars are added with updates, and the list grows over time."},{"question":"Which car is fastest?","answer":"Fully upgraded, the Porsche 911 GT3 and Dodge Challenger sit near the top of the straight-line speed charts, with the Supra close behind. Top speed matters less than you think though, in drifting, speed through transitions wins, not terminal velocity."},{"question":"Which car is best for drifting?","answer":"The community consensus is that the Silvia S15 and RX-7 are the best all-round drifters, with the Supra for long power slides and the E30 as the most forgiving. The best car is the one that matches your style, our tier list post breaks them all down."},{"question":"Can I get premium cars free in the original?","answer":"Occasionally, yes, event rewards and limited-time offers have given away premium cars in the past, but they are rare and time-gated. In practice, premium models like the 911 GT3 and Challenger are locked behind real money, which is why most players switch to the mod."},{"question":"Does the mod unlock cars in multiplayer?","answer":"The mod unlocks every car locally, and your selected car appears in multiplayer lobbies normally. One caveat: other players can see a premium car you haven't \"earned\", which can attract attention in public rooms, private lobbies avoid that entirely."},{"question":"What is the best first car?","answer":"The Toyota AE86 or the Mazda Miata. Both are light, low-power, and incredibly forgiving, which makes them perfect for learning angle control and weight transfer. The BMW E30 is a close third if you prefer a European starter."},{"question":"Which car has the most livery codes?","answer":"The Supra and RX-7 have the biggest livery libraries by far, followed by the AE86 and Silvia S15. Community designers tend to focus on the icons, if you want the widest choice of wraps, pick one of those four cars."}],
